msgstr "percorso"

#: ../../source/reference/configuration/options.md
#: ../../source/reference/configuration/options.md:114
msgid "none"
msgstr "nessuno"

#: ../../source/reference/configuration/options.md
msgid "read when formats are loaded; a repository without `metadata/formats.csv` fails there"
msgstr ""
"letto quando si caricano i formati; un repository senza `metadata/formats.csv` "
"fallisce lì"

#: ../../source/reference/configuration/options.md
msgid "`-r ~/work/formats-repo`"
msgstr "`-r ~/work/formats-repo`"

#: ../../source/reference/configuration/options.md:115
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"`freeports-dev` and `freeports-validate` read **`FREEPORTS_FORMATS_REPO`** — a "
"different variable name for the same thing. Export both. See {doc}`../cli/index`."
msgstr ""
"`freeports-dev` e `freeports-validate` leggono **`FREEPORTS_FORMATS_REPO`** — un nome"
" di variabile diverso per la stessa cosa. Esportale entrambe. Vedi "
"{doc}`../cli/index`."

